<title>SINGAPORE: Inno-Pac first half net loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Inno-Pac first half net loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(In millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit (loss)	   (9.94)  vs  (0.35)</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	(4.20)  vs  (0.16)</p>
<p>    Turnover			58.73   vs 102.22</p>
<p>    Other/Interest income	0.67   vs   1.13</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     2.55   vs   1.23</p>
<p>    Associates		    (0.18)  vs  (0.74)</p>
<p>    Pretax			 (13.33)  vs   0.17</p>
<p>    Minorities		     3.39   vs  (0.52)</p>
<p>    Tax				0.26   vs   1.51</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Inno-Pacific Holdings Ltd. The firm is an international trading and food products and retail company. -- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
